eden_354	Eden	Eden	Eden	Eden	\N	Region	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Unlocated	Not identifiable	\N	\N	Original location most likely unidentifiable due to the global flood	Old Testament	15	2 Kings 19:12	The garden in which our first parents dewlt (Gen. 2:8-17). No geographical question has been so much discussed as that bearing on its site. It has been placed in Armenia, in the region west of the Caspian Sea, in Media, near Damascus, in Palestine, in Southern Arabia, and in Babylonia. The site must undoubtedly be sought for somewhere along the course of the great streams the Tigris and the Euphrates of Western Asia, in “the land of Shinar” or Babylonia.	Easton's Bible Dictionary
